1f"},{"people_name":"齊桓公","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐桓公","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b63f5b15-db0e-11ef-bdc3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"桓公","people_name_jianti_auto":"桓公","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b63f5b16-db0e-11ef-a552-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"寺人披","people_name_jianti_auto":"寺人披","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b63f5b17-db0e-11ef-9f65-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"重耳","people_name_jianti_auto":"重耳","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"b63f5b18-db0e-11ef-bf4c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"文公","people_name_jianti_auto":"文公","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"b63f5b19-db0e-11ef-8fc3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"管仲射齊桓公中帶鉤，桓公用之以相。寺人披伐公子重耳，斬其袪，文公不怨。今以袪爲袂。射，而亦翻。幾，居希翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"管仲射齐桓公中带钩，桓公用之以相。寺人披伐公子重耳，斩其袪，文公不怨。今以袪为袂。射，而亦翻。几，居希翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"b63f5b13-db0e-11ef-8b21-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"帥，所類翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"帅，所类翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":139,"tongjian_id":"b63f5b1b-db0e-11ef-b912-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"衞州","place_name_jianti_auto":"衞州","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b63f5b1d-db0e-11ef-a5ff-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","place_note":"首都大兴【陕西省西安市】","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b63f5b1e-db0e-11ef-a5d1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汲郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"汲郡","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"b63f5b1f-db0e-11ef-8b7f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"林慮山","place_name_jianti_auto":"林虑山","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b63f5b20-db0e-11ef-8ebd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏郡","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b63f5b21-db0e-11ef-96d3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"林慮縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"林虑县","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"b63f5b22-db0e-11ef-8509-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"衞州，隋爲汲郡。林慮山，在魏郡林慮縣。慮，音廬。","note_content_jianti_auto":"衞州，隋为汲郡。林虑山，在魏郡林虑县。虑，音庐。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":151,"tongjian_id":"b63f5b1c-db0e-11ef-9635-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"宋州","place_name_jianti_auto":"宋州","place_note":"河南省商丘县","resolved_place_entity_id":372,"start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"b63f5b2a-db0e-11ef-94c4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"6李密遣房彥藻、鄭頲等東出黎陽，分道招慰州縣。以梁郡太守楊汪爲上柱國、宋州總管，又以手書與之曰：「昔在雍丘，曾相追捕，射鉤斬袂，不敢庶幾。」汪遣使往來通意，密亦羈縻待之。彥藻以書招竇建德，使來見密。建德復書，卑辭厚禮，託以羅藝南侵，請捍禦北垂。彥藻還，至衞州，賊帥王德仁邀殺之。德仁有衆數萬，據林慮山，四出抄掠，爲數州之患。","content_fanyi":"李密派房彦藻、郑颋等人向东前往黎阳，分路招抚各州县。又任命梁郡太守杨汪为上柱国、宋州总管，并亲笔写信对他说：“从前在雍丘时，你曾奉命追捕我。管仲射中齐桓公的带钩，后来却做了国相；寺人披斩断晋文公的衣袖，晋文公也没有怨恨。我不敢和他们相比，只求做得差不多。”杨汪派使者往来表达归顺之意，李密也刻意笼络他。房彦藻写信招窦建德，要他来见李密。窦建德回信言辞谦卑，又送上厚礼，借口罗艺即将南侵，请求留在北方守卫边境，不肯来见李密。房彦藻返回，走到卫州，贼帅王德仁拦击杀死了他。王德仁有兵数万人，盘踞林虑山，四出抄掠，成为数州的大患。","content_jianti_auto":"6李密遣房彦藻、郑颋等东出黎阳，分道招慰州县。以梁郡太守杨汪为上柱国、宋州总管，又以手书与之曰：「昔在雍丘，曾相追捕，射钩斩袂，不敢庶几。」汪遣使往来通意，密亦羁縻待之。彦藻以书招窦建德，使来见密。建德复书，卑辞厚礼，托以罗艺南侵，请捍御北垂。彦藻还，至衞州，贼帅王德仁邀杀之。德仁有众数万，据林虑山，四出抄掠，为数州之患。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17824,"number":6,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百八十五 (唐紀一) / 高祖神堯大聖光孝皇帝上之上 / 武德元年 / 第 8 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b63f5b0c-db0e-11ef-af8f-a0d3651f611f","year_int":618},"tongjian_id":"b63f5b0c-db0e-11ef-af8f-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"宋州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],